# The whole suite on HashLink.
#
# hl-ver says which HashLink the bytecode is for. Haxe 4.3 assumes 1.12, and
# haxe.atomic (which crossbyte.utils.Random uses) will not compile for hl
# below 1.13, so without this the build stops inside the standard library with
# "Atomic operations require HL 1.13+". The runtime must be 1.13 or later.
#
# Run from the repository root, where the suite's resources are found:
#   hl export/hl/CrossByteTests.hl
-cp src
-cp tests
-lib utest
-D hl-ver=1.13.0
-main TestMain
--hl export/hl/CrossByteTests.hl
--macro crossbyte.test.SuiteCoverage.check()
